  "head_before_commit": "c83c5e55722f696cf155834fe6fdb38b0e4bc542",
  "result": "Focused qualification passes. No reference file retires. The complete migration and final Rust procedure are Not done.",
  "behavior": [
    "Session registers an exact saved managed call dataset as a native table alias. Installation and admission start no Discovery.",
    "Data creates the opaque exact reference without loading Arrow IPC. The existing source transaction checks tenant, generation, call, result, current head, stored scope, source versions, trace reads, context heads and original evidence expiry.",
    "Native planning and the existing physical source scan capture the saved dataset with other declared inputs. The producer does not run again.",
    "Data prepays encoded lengths and SDK decode bounds, then runs complete stored result validation. Equal exact references and schemas decode once; Arrow buffers share their existing claims.",
    "A full identity input keeps original revision and coverage. Narrowed, reordered, filtered or derived input uses the existing native fingerprint. Inherited revision order uses the complete stable revision tuple.",
    "All reads leave stored outputs, state and progress unchanged. Logical input limits count both alias payloads. Final alias drop releases the actual memory claim."
  ],
